# Silicon Labs Project Configuration Tools: slcp, v0, Component selection file.
project_name: FFN
label: FFN
description: The Wi-SUN Node Monitoring sample application is a non-CLI application,
  as most field applications. It uses UART only to print messages, with no input capability.
  It adds OTA DFU & CoAP support to monitor the device connection status. It can be
  easily expanded to monitor sensors and control actuators. Various statistics can
  be made available via CoAP, depending on defined values.
category: Wi-SUN Examples
filter:
- name: Device Type
  value:
  - SoC
- name: Project Difficulty
  value:
  - Advanced
- name: Wireless Technology
  value:
  - Wi-SUN
package: wisun
quality: experimental
readme:
- path: README.md
- path: app_parameters.md
source:
- path: app_check_neighbors.c
- path: app_coap.c
- path: app.c
- path: app_direct_connect.c
- path: app_init.c
- path: app_list_configs.c
- path: app_parameters.c
- path: app_rtt_traces.c
- path: app_reporter.c
- path: app_tcp_server.c
- path: app_timestamp.c
- path: app_udp_server.c
- path: app_wisun_multicast_ota.c
- path: app_action_scheduler.c
- path: main.c
- path: app_crash_handler.c
include:
- path: .
  file_list:
